  m_Name: M3_01_Welcome_Route_Optimisation
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: Assembly-CSharp::Valari.Data.TutorialData
  <Title>k__BackingField: Welcome to Route Optimisation
  <Description>k__BackingField: Route optimisation is one of the highest-leverage
    improvements available in any warehouse operation. A picker who walks an inefficient
    route through the warehouse wastes time on every single order, and those wasted
    minutes compound across hundreds of picks per shift, thousands of shifts per
    year. Studies show that unoptimised picking routes add 20 to 40 percent unnecessary
    travel distance compared to a planned route. In this module you will learn zone
    sequencing, batched picking, how to re-route around obstacles, and how to use
    the AI path comparison tool to measure your own efficiency.
  <VoiceOver>k__BackingField: {fileID: 8300000, guid: f7848e7ba45cc844380717d71f9253d2, type: 3}
